<title>UK: Tambang Timah at $12.2 in London.</title>
<headline>Tambang Timah at $12.2 in London.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Tambang Timah closed at $12.2 per GDR in London on Tuesday. It recorded the day's low of $11.975 and the day's high of $12.2.</p>
<p>It closed at $11.8 on Monday.</p>
<p>One Global Depository Receipt represents 10 common shares. -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
